ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930040/extras/6d60fcb84c93f8ca5215c8c371a2a767.poster.avif?t=1729782281\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930040/extras/6d60fcb84c93f8ca5215c8c371a2a767.webm?t=1729782281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930040/extras/6d60fcb84c93f8ca5215c8c371a2a767.mp4?t=1729782281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Every day is different in Mercapolis, adapt to each day as if it were the last.</strong><br><br>Various random events will occur during the day, and you'll need to be prepared as a manager to face them. Robberies, fires, or even health inspectors issuing fines if you're not vigilant enough.<br><br><br>Project made for the Espetos Studios in Interactive Product Design degree of U-tad, University of Technology, Arts and Design.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930040/extras/5d7b621585f3e8e904dfd32fcfb0f3f1.avif?t=1729782281\" width=609 height=140 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930040/extras/977a358916da6818bb8fcf8a7fd0abb6.avif?t=1729782281\" width=180 height=88 /></span>",
